  "tekst": "Remote CFO & Accounting Solutions, LLC is a Tampa, Florida–based financial-services business. Florida corporate records show it was formed on November 12, 2021, remains active as of its 2026 annual report, and is managed by Julia Dospehoff. Its registered/principal address is 10139 Heather Sound Drive, Tampa, FL 33647. ([search.sunbiz.org](https://search.sunbiz.org/Inquiry/CorporationSearch/GetDocument?aggregateId=flal-l21000488130-2e624945-25aa-449f-880a-4bfffb23ecbb&formatType=PDF&transactionId=l21000488130-a17b9744-6e6b-4621-89f9-f0f2d6471403&utm_source=openai))\n\nThe public information about the firm's exact service menu is fairly limited. Based on its name and Julia Dospehoff's public business profiles, it appears to provide outsourced accounting and CFO-type services to businesses—that is, functioning as an external finance/accounting resource rather than requiring a company to hire a full-time CFO or accounting department. ([alignable.com](https://www.alignable.com/tampa-fl/cti?utm_source=openai))\n\nIn practical terms, firms in this category typically help businesses with bookkeeping/accounting oversight, financial reporting, budgeting and forecasting, cash-flow management, financial analysis, and higher-level CFO guidance. However, I wouldn't attribute every one of those specific services to Remote CFO & Accounting Solutions without stronger first-party evidence; I didn't find a detailed official company website in the search results.\n\nIf you're looking at them because you're considering hiring them, working there, or evaluating them as part of a business transaction, I can dig further into Julia Dospehoff, the firm's clients/reputation, services, business history, and any reviews or professional credentials I can verify.",
